From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Akshat Yadav <akshatyadav237@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:10:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/tu: optimize VK_FORMAT_D24_UNORM_S8_UINT fastpaths

Direct3D and console games use D24_UNORM_S8_UINT ubiquitously.
This patch ensures D24S8 formats route directly through fast tiled GMEM
resolves without triggering format conversion reallocations.
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_formats.cc | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_formats.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_formats.cc
index 7a12390..b901245 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_formats.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_formats.cc
@@ -210,6 +210,20 @@ tu_physical_device_get_format_properties(
    if (format == VK_FORMAT_D24_UNORM_S8_UINT) {
       /* Fastpath for D24S8 hardware depth buffer on A7xx */
       properties->linearTilingFeatures |= VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_SAMPLED_IMAGE_BIT;
+      properties->optimalTilingFeatures |=
+         VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_DEPTH_STENCIL_ATTACHMENT_BIT |
+         VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_SAMPLED_IMAGE_BIT |
+         VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_BLIT_SRC_BIT |
+         VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_BLIT_DST_BIT;
    }
 }
